 PR to the approved issue and auto-closes it on merge.\n  - If there are any breaking changes, please clearly describe them.\n- If this PR depends on another PR being merged first, please include\n\"Depends on #PR_NUMBER\" in the description.\n\n3. Run `make format`, `make lint` and `make test` from the root of the\npackage(s) you've modified.\n\n  - We will not consider a PR unless these three are passing in CI.\n\n4. How did you verify your code works?\n\nAdditional guidelines:\n\n- All external PRs must link to an issue or discussion where a solution\nhas been approved by a maintainer, and you must be assigned to that\nissue. PRs without prior approval will be closed.\n- PRs should not touch more than one package unless absolutely\nnecessary.\n- Do not update the `uv.lock` files or add dependencies to\n`pyproject.toml` files (even optional ones) unless you have explicit\npermission to do so by a maintainer.\n\n## Social handles (optional)\n<!-- If you'd like a shoutout on release, add your socials below -->\nTwitter: @\nLinkedIn: https://linkedin.com/in/","verified_at":"2026-05-29T20:46:11Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/a9b0a05fb53ca1e4dfdfaf885171b45bd276569f","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/a9b0a05fb53ca1e4dfdfaf885171b45bd276569f","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/a9b0a05fb53ca1e4dfdfaf885171b45bd276569f/comments","author":{"login":"syachamaneni-lc","id":283806641,"node_id":"U_kgDOEOqLsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/283806641?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/syachamaneni-lc","html_url":"https://github.com/syachamaneni-lc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syachamaneni-lc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syachamaneni-lc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syachamaneni-lc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/syacha