iptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"6e4a295ba5003353c55a3ba53fecf4780590ae7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/6e4a295ba5003353c55a3ba53fecf4780590ae7e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/6e4a295ba5003353c55a3ba53fecf4780590ae7e"}]},{"sha":"6e4a295ba5003353c55a3ba53fecf4780590ae7e","node_id":"C_kwDOKFU0ldoAKDZlNGEyOTViYTUwMDMzNTNjNTVhM2JhNTNmZWNmNDc4MDU5MGFlN2U","commit":{"author":{"name":"Asamu David","email":"david.asamu@langchain.dev","date":"2026-05-27T22:26:39Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-05-27T22:26:39Z"},"message":"fix(cli): pin internal_docker deploy images by digest (#7924)\n\n## Summary\n\n`langgraph deploy` now pins images by digest when handing the URI to the\nLangGraph host backend. After `docker push`, the CLI reads the manifest\ndigest from the local Docker daemon's `RepoDigests` and sends\n`registry/repo@sha256:<hex>` to the host backend instead of the\ntag-based reference. Mutable tags cause downstream inconsistency — the\nsame revision can refer to different images over time.\n\nThe image is still pushed under the user-supplied `--tag` (default\n`:latest`) so it stays discoverable by tag in the registry — only the\nURI persisted with the revision changes.\n\n## Behavior on failure\n\nIf the digest can't be resolved (empty `RepoDigests`, or no entry\nmatching the just-pushed repo), the CLI warns and falls back to the\ntag-based reference. Deploys never fail on a digest-resolution issue.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `make test` passes (new `TestResolvePushedImageDigest` cases\nincluded)\n- [x] `--verbose` deploy shows the `docker image inspect` call resolving\n  the digest\n- [x] Deploy with a clean Docker daemon (no matching `RepoDigests`)\n  emits the fallback warning and still completes successfully\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Josh Rogers <josh@langchain.dev>","tree":{"sha":"92c0e988c6f8e46f6f652ab987768e6b862eb59f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/git/trees/92c0e988c6f8e46f6f652ab987768e6b862eb59f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/git/commits/6e4a295ba5003353c55a3ba53fecf4780590ae7e","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqF2+fCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3MYQAGPZtsk3jL6+xPnZ8cEzQQ4q\nwrMA75M4xWAzi8VS/9pwV0LPQRPs9rBvsrg+x2wW2o+rD1wkDxdqXqbh39P129i3\ncXqnXFi/LPwYf0lIaR5n1E3DagEuVXw1mufKiaE42kcnM1cMNhd/HYxhnbFU7bU1\nwnb88BNqQ85JAv3qXi+fkKQn3U+GGY8SzDPNHyMByEiDSPMS/DeRsWpg4/ne7rqC\nwNXOw2FDwjE5sR/fKRLtv9u4YDHEzD1nqW3+q9xIA67aPxCUjh2C9y2GvqfefRot\nwRPqKiJJv/FMSY6SEGbLUS/JZw8ogTzzXaPKb4rpcnS8nufZN4HHQiu5ujt+k0Fy\nZy4R4bz61EpzLozfR+nUQU5sJhsNsYpM3WIXcX1ajq3UjKZsPhJw3pEee6kPmxfz\nibcJx3iG6kv+NRmLdS9LFo5BL3zX0xkx5knzM2usjg8x90tKGhv5mm2edXY0yh24\n4mVCMiKk5LI9rCckcJCQmY2V85J7+C7fxtOx2u9bhucMcMO7foO8QNfyeKXM8oni\n68/y/wvc2VLo1bZ+EHBojuSgGGyJ3DDvjPhLYe/e1ADyBso7FbJPRayBD8jX9BtT\nCl0OMPfxzrnkl2q+1sfLV1wP2jNKCG7C2NxSGq/U6wqbabgnrPJRwEWF0vfe3qte\n4FHeK4r+Fg3r5Lqp0u0B\n=E+d2\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 92c0e988c6f8e46f6f652ab987768e6b862eb59f\nparent b4018e822287af7ce882ca96be2a8c6191a7792c\nauthor Asamu David <david.asamu@langchain.dev> 1779920799 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779920799 -0400\n\nfix(cli): pin internal_docker deploy images by digest (#7924)\n\n## Summary\n\n`langgraph deploy` now pins images by digest when handing the URI to the\nLangGraph host backend. After `docker push`, the CLI reads the manifest\ndigest from the local Docker daemon's `RepoDigests` and sends\n`registry/repo@sha256:<hex>` to the host backend instead of the\ntag-based reference. Mutable tags cause downstream inconsistency — the\nsame revision can refer to different images over time.\n\nThe image is still pushed under the user-supplied `--tag` (default\n`:latest`) so it stays discoverable by tag in the registry — only the\nURI persisted with the revision changes.\n\n## Behavior on failure\n\nIf the digest can't be resolved (empty `RepoDigests`, or no entry\nmatching the just-pushed repo), the CLI warns and falls back to the\ntag-based reference. Deploys never fail on a digest-resolution issue.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `make test` passes (new `TestResolvePushedImageDigest` cases\nincluded)\n- [x] `--verbose` deploy shows the `docker image inspect` call resolving\n  the digest\n- [x] Deploy with a clean Docker daemon (no matching `RepoDigests`)\n  emits the fallback warning and still completes successfully\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Josh Rogers <josh@langchain.dev>","verified_at":"2026-05-27T22:26:39Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/6e4a295ba5003353c55a3ba53fecf4780590ae7e","html_url":"https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph/commit/6e4a295ba5003353c55a3ba53fecf4780590ae7e","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/langchain-ai/langgraph/commits/6e4a295ba5003353c55a3ba53fecf4780590ae7e/comments","author":{"login":"phvash","id":17913873,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3OTEzODcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17913873?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/phvash","html_url":"https://github.com/phvash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phvash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phvash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phvash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phvash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phvash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.gith